          "text": "Kĩĩo nĩkĩw’ĩke kuma nyũmbanĩ syoo, yĩla wĩmaetee nguthu na kĩthũlũmũko; nũndũ nĩmenzĩte ĩima mangwatye, na kũvitha itei ingwatye maũũ. ",
